  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strategic Fund 2019 - Cambodian Journalist Alliance (CamboJA)</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Strategic Fund 2019</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Syftet med den Strategiska fonden &#xe4;r att finansiera mindre initiativ som &#xe4;r strategiska f&#xf6;r genomf&#xf6;randet av Resultatstrategin f&#xf6;r Sveriges internationella bist&#xe5;nd till Kambodja, men som faller utanf&#xf6;r ramen f&#xf6;r de st&#xf6;rre bidragen inom respektive resultatomr&#xe5;de/sektor. Initiativ som kan finansieras genom den Strategiska fonden &#xe4;r exempelvis f&#xf6;rberedande studier, revisioner, utv&#xe4;rderingar, studiebes&#xf6;k, &#xf6;vers&#xe4;ttningar och publikationer. Insatser som &#xe4;r begr&#xe4;nsade i tid och arbetsinsats s&#xe5;som bidrag till angivna kostnadsobjekt f&#xf6;r en konferens eller dylikt kan ocks&#xe5; finansieras inom fonden.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose with the Strategic Fund is to finance smaller initiatives that are strategic for the implementation of the Results strategy for Sweden&apos;s international development cooperation for Cambodia, but fall outside the framework of the larger contributions in the respective results area/sector. Initiatives that can be financed through the Strategic Fund are preparatory studies, reviews, audits, evaluations, study visits, translations and publications. Contributions that are limited in time and workload such as a payment of specified cost items for a conference or such may also be financed through the contribution.</narrative>
  </description>
